From: ACK72
Subject: [PATCH] flowsense: show sampled latency and CPU availability

SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

Consolidate the mean-RTT/stale-sample display and CPU-availability fixes.
Keep valid zero samples distinct from missing measurements.

--- a/package/luci-app-airoha-flowsense/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airoha_flowsense/status.js
+++ b/package/luci-app-airoha-flowsense/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airoha_flowsense/status.js
@@ -693,17 +693,35 @@
